:59.370" end="00:59.460">ya</span><span begin="00:59.460" end="00:59.460">, </span><span begin="00:59.460" end="00:59.550">look </span><span begin="00:59.550" end="00:59.610">at </span><span begin="00:59.610" end="00:59.760">ya</span><span begin="00:59.760" end="00:59.820">, </span><span begin="00:59.820" end="01:00.060">look </span><span begin="01:00.060" end="01:00.300">at </span><span begin="01:00.300" end="01:00.450">ya</span><span begin="01:00.450" end="01:00.510">, </span><span begin="01:00.510" end="01:00.720">look </span><span begin="01:00.720" end="01:00.900">at </span><span begin="01:00.900" end="01:00.960">ya</span><span begin="01:00.960" end="01:00.960">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.960" end="01:02.280"><span begin="01:00.960" end="01:01.080">（</span><span begin="01:01.080" end="01:01.200">Ladies </span><span begin="01:01.200" end="01:01.320">and </span><span begin="01:01.320" end="01:01.440">gentlemen</span><span begin="01:01.440" end="01:01.560">, </span><span begin="01:01.560" end="01:01.680">ladies</span><span begin="01:01.680" end="01:01.800">, </span><span begin="01:01.800" end="01:01.920">ladies </span><span begin="01:01.920" end="01:02.040">and </span><span begin="01:02.040" end="01:02.160">gentlemen</span><span begin="01:02.160" end="01:02.280">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.280" end="01:07.230"><span begin="01:02.280" end="01:02.550">And </span><span begin="01:02.550" end="01:02.700">I </span><span begin="01:02.700" end="01:03.360">always </span><span begin="01:03.360" end="01:03.780">find</span><span begin="01:03.780" end="01:03.780">, </span><span begin="01:03.780" end="01:04.050">yeah</span><span begin="01:04.050" end="01:04.050">, </span><span begin="01:04.050" end="01:04.080">I </span><span begin="01:04.080" end="01:04.740">always </span><span begin="01:04.740" end="01:05.100">find </span><span begin="01:05.100" end="01:05.610">something </span><span begin="01:05.610" end="01:07.230">wrong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.890" end="01:12.600"><span begin="01:07.890" end="01:08.220">You </span><span begin="01:08.220" end="01:08.370">been </span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:08.790">putting </span><span begin="01:08.790" end="01:08.940">up </span><span begin="01:08.940" end="01:09.180">with </span><span begin="01:09.180" end="01:09.450">my </span><span begin="01:09.450" end="01:09.870">shit </span><span begin="01:09.870" end="01:10.230">just </span><span begin="01:10.230" end="01:10.710">way </span><span begin="01:10.710" end="01:10.950">too </span><span begin="01:10.950" end="01:12.600">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.320" end="01:17.400"><span begin="01:13.320" end="01:13.500">I'm </span><span begin="01:13.500" end="01:13.830">so </span><span begin="01:13.830" end="01:14.310">gifted </span><span begin="01:14.310" end="01:14.400">at </span><span begin="01:14.400" end="01:15.090">finding </span><span begin="01:15.090" end="01:15.300">what </span><span begin="01:15.300" end="01:15.660">I </span><span begin="01:15.660" end="01:15.900">don't </span><span begin="01:15.900" end="01:16.290">like </span><span begin="01:16.290" end="01:16.410">the </span><span begin="01:16.410" end="01:17.400">most</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.870" end="01:22.950"><span begin="01:18.870" end="01:19.290">So </span><span begin="01:19.290" end="01:19.380">I </span><span begin="01:19.380" end="01:19.710">think </span><span begin="01:19.710" end="01:19.950">it's </span><span begin="01:19.950" end="01:20.430">time </span><span begin="01:20.430" end="01:20.820">for </span><span begin="01:20.820" end="01:21.300">us </span><span begin="01:21.300" end="01:21.510">to </span><span begin="01:21.510" end="01:22.050">have </span><span begin="01:22.050" end="01:22.110">a </span><span begin="01:22.110" end="01:22.950">toast</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.010" end="01:25.530"><span begin="01:23.010" end="01:23.250">Let's </span><span begin="01:23.250" end="01:23.460">have </span><span begin="01:23.460" end="01:23.520">a </span><span begin="01:23.520" end="01:23.880">toast </span><span begin="01:23.880" end="01:24.090">for </span><span begin="01:24.090" end="01:24.180">the </span><span begin="01:24.180" end="01:25.530">douchebags</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.740" end="01:28.470"><span begin="01:25.740" end="01:25.980">Let's </span><span begin="01:25.980" end="01:26.220">have </span><span begin="01:26.220" end="01:26.250">a </span><span begin="01:26.250" end="01:26.640">toast </span><span begin="01:26.640" end="01:26.880">for </span><span begin="01:26.880" end="01:26.970">the </span><span begin="01:26.970" end="01:28.470">assholes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.530" end="01:31.170"><span begin="01:28.530" end="01:28.740">Let's </span><span begin="01:28.740" end="01:28.980">have </span><span begin="01:28.980" end="01:29.040">a </span><span begin="01:29.040" end="01:29.400">toast </span><span begin="01:29.400" end="01:29.610">for </span><span begin="01:29.610" end="01:29.670">the </span><span begin="01:29.670" end="01:31.170">scumbags</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.440" end="01:33.990"><span begin="01:31.440" end="01:31.770">Every </span><span begin="01:31.770" end="01:32.070">one </span><span begin="01:32.070" end="01:32.160">of </span><span begin="01:32.160" end="01:32.370">them </span><span begin="01:32.370" end="01:32.580">that </span><span begin="01:32.580" end="01:32.820">I </span><span begin="01:32.820" end="01:33.990">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.050" end="01:36.660"><span begin="01:34.050" end="01:34.260">Let's </span><span begin="01:34.260" end="01:34.470">have </span><span begin="01:34.470" end="01:34.530">a </span><span begin="01:34.530" end="01:34.890">toast </span><span begin="01:34.890" end="01:35.130">for </span><span begin="01:35.130" end="01:35.190">the </span><span begin="01:35.190" end="01:35.610">jerk</span><span begin="01:35.610" end="01:36.210">-</span><span begin="01: